    "### Section 4: MODEL TRAINING STRATEGIES\n",
    "\n",
    "### Penjelasan\n",
    "\n",
    "Bagian ini mencakup strategi training model yang komprehensif:\n",
    "- **Multiple backbone architectures**: MobileNetV2, EfficientNet-B0/B1/B2, ResNet variants\n",
    "- **Transfer learning**: Fine-tuning pre-trained models on GTSRB\n",
    "- **Training loop with progress tracking**: Epoch-based training with metrics tracking\n",
